 "last_rtl_message": {
  "stage": "rtl-design-creation",
  "visit": 3,
  "text": "DONE. The simulation failure came from the ROM file path, and all three seeds now pass (`simulate` ran 3 tests, all passed).\n\n`rtl/p2_core.sv` used `$readmemh` with a repo-root path (`runs/.../data/rom_init.hex`). The simulator doesn't run from the repo root, so it never found the file and ROM_DATA read 0. I changed the `ROM_FILE` default to `data/rom_init.hex`, which is relative to the design directory. Nothing else in the file changed.\n\nLint is clean. I did not run `check` with `[\"all\"]` or any synthesis. The new path has not been tried in Vivado synthesis, which may resolve a relative path from a different working directory than the simulator does.\n\nI first tried a fallback that tested the file with `$fopen` and an alternate `../` path. The tool refused it as reaching outside the simulator, so I dropped it."
 },
